    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "matsatsi a šupa",
      "rationale": "Palo ya boipela bja matsatsi a šupa e laetšwe ka botlalo go swana le Seheberu שבעת ימים."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "go Sause",
      "rationale": "Taetšo ya tlwaelo ya Samele go Sause — o mo laetša go theoga Gilgale le go emela."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme o tla theoga pele ga me go Gilgale; gomme bonang, ke be ke theoga go wena, go nea dihlabelo tša go fišwa le go hlabela dihlabelo tša kagiso; matsatsi a šupa o tla emela, go fihla ge ke tla go wena, gomme ke tla go tsebiša ⟨את⟩ seo o tlango o se dira.",
